  "body": "An exceptional coastal residence where sophisticated design, premium finishes and effortless functionality come together to create an outstanding lifestyle by the water.\r\n\r\nFloor-to-ceiling glazing captures beautiful beach and Waiheke Island views, filling the home with natural light and ensuring the stunning outlook takes centre stage. Multiple living and entertaining spaces provide plenty of room to relax or host guests, highlighted by an impressive high-stud open-plan living, dining and kitchen area.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a spectacular gourmet kitchen featuring a striking marble waterfall island, premium Gaggenau and Liebherr appliances, and a fully equipped butler’s pantry – designed for both everyday living and entertaining on a grand scale.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is equally impressive, with five luxurious bedrooms. The master suite offers a beautifully appointed ensuite and a walk-in wardrobe with floor-to-ceiling storage. Glass-fronted wardrobes add another contemporary touch, while two ground-floor bedrooms, both with ensuites, provide excellent flexibility for guests or extended family.\r\n\r\nEvery detail has been carefully considered. Premium features include an integrated smart-home system with smart door access, intercom, cameras and music, along with automatic gates, bathroom underfloor heating, air conditioning and fireplace. An internally accessed double garage completes the package.\r\n\r\nPositioned in sought-after Eastern Beach, this is coastal living at its finest. Enjoy morning walks along the waterfront, paddleboarding, swimming or simply taking in the seaside atmosphere.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate zoning for highly regarded local schools, including Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College, while convenient access to surrounding amenities and the wider city makes everyday living easy.\r\n\r\nA remarkable combination of luxury, location and lifestyle – make it yours.",
